Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:23.72,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進屋裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:38.01,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-啊...    -啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（電話鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}蝶華妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 亂暴獸在我附近搞破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在市中心吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！小空一個人往這裡來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（轟隆！）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:20:59.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來想辦法！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會用幻鏡平板尋找具體的地方 然後聯絡你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小翼弟弟 你快進屋裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你千萬不能冒險
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是遇到Precure的話 就把小空交給她們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後去安全的地方避難
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:18.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:23.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你們究竟哪一方更強 今天便是要分個清楚啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:31.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:36.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:39.17,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空有危險
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.11,0:21:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,判斷風向
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:09.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Grace！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:09.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,975)}優雅愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:13.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起 手牽手 心頭一緊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 連阿翼都來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:50.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要接近亂暴獸這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:53.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼高的地方 光是跳起來 根本搆不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.42,0:23:54.72,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.99,0:23:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.97,0:23:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定會保護你的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.58,0:24:00.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.58,0:24:00.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣之翼 飛吧 Cure Wing!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1160,970)}飛翼愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:12.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:18.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:23.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:31.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:36.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:40.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:42.18,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:46.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:51.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:53.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:57.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:02:01.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:06.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:06.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:12.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:17.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:22.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:27.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:30.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.33,0:02:38.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:29.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.68,0:22:34.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:37.02,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.02,0:22:38.83,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:41.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:44.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:46.09,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:48.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:51.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.55,0:22:53.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:55.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:23:02.45,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:08.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:10.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:15.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:19.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:25.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:29.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:33.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:37.47,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:38.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.86,0:23:41.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
